    "instructions": "The Coffee & Contracts connector is read-only. It can read the member's content, calendar, Instagram insights and leads, and it cannot change, delete or export anything. When asked to change a lead's stage, edit a lead or export leads, say the connector is read-only and point the member to Leads in Coffee & Contracts, where Export CSV is.",
